          "id": "p6-b27",
          "text": "Table 3. Linear-probe transfer for image classification. Linear-evaluation on downstream image classification tasks. I-JEPA sig-nificantly outperforms previous methods that also do not use aug-mentations (MAE and data2vec), and decreases the gap with the best view-invariance-based methods that leverage hand-crafted data augmentations during pretraining.",
